<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA V SOUTH AFRICA SCOREBOARD, 2ND TEST 2ND DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA V SOUTH AFRICA SCOREBOARD, 2ND TEST 2ND DAY.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the second day of</p>
<p>the second test between India and South Africa at Eden Gardens</p>
<p>on Thursday:</p>
<p>South Africa first innings (overnight 339-2)</p>
<p> A.Hudson b Prasad			   146</p>
<p> G.Kirsten b Srinath			 102</p>
<p> H.Gibbs lbw b Prasad			 31</p>
<p> D.Cullinan lbw b Prasad		    43</p>
