<p> B.McMillan lbw Prasad			 0</p>
<p> D.Richardson not out			 36</p>
<p> L.Klusener b Prasad			  10</p>
<p> P.Symcox b Prasad			    13</p>
<p> A.Donald c Laxman b Kumble		  0</p>
<p> P.Adams b Kumble				4</p>
<p> Extras (b-6 lb-24 nb-9)		    39</p>
<p> Total					   428</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-236 2-296 3-346 4-361 5-362 6-363 7-379</p>
<p>8-421 9-422</p>
<p>Bowling: Srinath 37-7-107-2 (2nb), Prasad 35-6-104-6 (5nb),</p>
<p>Joshi 12-1-48-0, Ganguly 3-1-10-0, Kumble 20.1-1-78-2, Hirwani</p>
<p>14-2-51-0 (2nb).</p>
